    "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo Launch This Monday + Full Steam Deck &amp; Gamepad Support</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack and Climb </strong>is dropping its <strong>free demo this Monday</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your first chance to grab your weapon, climb the mountain, and feel the pain of every glorious fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo also includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae A brand new <strong>gamepad layout</strong> with two modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Full <strong>Steam Deck compatibility</strong>! Play <strong>anywhere</strong>, fall <strong>everywhere</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've successfully tested the game on the Steam Deck, and we're happy to say it's fully playable. You can use the standard &quot;Gamepad&quot; controls or the touchscreen for more precise input \u2014 but honestly, we recommend using the Steam Deck's excellent trackpads as joysticks with Twin Stick mode enabled. It gives you the comfort of a gamepad with the precision of a mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your <strong>WISHLIST</strong>, set your alarm, and prepare to chop!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=432 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>CURSED\u00a0</strong>into <strong>STEEL\u00a0</strong>and cast into the <strong>ABYSS</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>HE</strong> left you to <strong>RUST</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Instead you <strong>CLIMB</strong>, one spiteful <strong>THROW\u00a0</strong>at a time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Your <strong>RISE\u00a0</strong>will be his <strong>DOWNFALL</strong>....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/f90ce3bcdb1ebace6d37934dff12e14f.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/f90ce3bcdb1ebace6d37934dff12e14f.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack And Climb\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>physics</strong>-<strong>based</strong> platformer where you play as a <strong>cursed axe</strong> on a grueling ascent in search of revenge.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/068f1971b5d865fb57f9c1ada9fd686a.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=360 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/068f1971b5d865fb57f9c1ada9fd686a.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=432 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE AXE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your tool with <strong>precision</strong>. <strong>Every</strong> throw is a <strong>risk</strong>, every landing a <strong>triumph</strong>. Miss your mark and pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/5f9ef82d089cb80cb7516fedae941e51.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/5f9ef82d089cb80cb7516fedae941e51.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/5f9ef82d089cb80cb7516fedae941e51.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK NEW WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim up to 10 unique weapons! Each of them with their own quirks and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/b00fc2f96b72c3218e804ea7f824f7f2.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=256 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/b00fc2f96b72c3218e804ea7f824f7f2.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=486 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE CLIMB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore breathtaking and untamed environments. Swing through ancient mines, navigate rain-slicked forests, and brave the freezing storms of the mountain.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/b97a9e74d12fda63264aaeb75f09397c.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/b97a9e74d12fda63264aaeb75f09397c.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a combination of precise, skill-based gameplay and beautiful, atmospheric environments <strong>Hack And Climb</strong> is a game that anyone can play, but only few can master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/4673127c7a4383823c21154a4155d905.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/4673127c7a4383823c21154a4155d905.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based Platforming</strong>: Master the art of throwing and climbing with your axe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unlockable Weapons</strong>: Discover new ways to conquer &quot;The Climb&quot; as you progress.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but Fair</strong>: Each stage tests your skills while rewarding persistence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Landscapes</strong>: Explore breathtaking, untamed environments each with unique mechanics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Hard&quot; and &quot;Legendary&quot; Difficulties</strong>: Reaching the peak is just the beginning.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=432 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>CURSED\u00a0</strong>into <strong>STEEL\u00a0</strong>and cast into the <strong>ABYSS</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>HE</strong> left you to <strong>RUST</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Instead you <strong>CLIMB</strong>, one spiteful <strong>THROW\u00a0</strong>at a time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Your <strong>RISE\u00a0</strong>will be his <strong>DOWNFALL</strong>....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/f90ce3bcdb1ebace6d37934dff12e14f.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/f90ce3bcdb1ebace6d37934dff12e14f.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack And Climb\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>physics</strong>-<strong>based</strong> platformer where you play as a <strong>cursed axe</strong> on a grueling ascent in search of revenge.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/068f1971b5d865fb57f9c1ada9fd686a.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=360 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/068f1971b5d865fb57f9c1ada9fd686a.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=432 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE AXE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your tool with <strong>precision</strong>. <strong>Every</strong> throw is a <strong>risk</strong>, every landing a <strong>triumph</strong>. Miss your mark and pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/5f9ef82d089cb80cb7516fedae941e51.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/5f9ef82d089cb80cb7516fedae941e51.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/5f9ef82d089cb80cb7516fedae941e51.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK NEW WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim up to 10 unique weapons! Each of them with their own quirks and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/b00fc2f96b72c3218e804ea7f824f7f2.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=256 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/b00fc2f96b72c3218e804ea7f824f7f2.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=486 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.mp4?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE CLIMB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore breathtaking and untamed environments. Swing through ancient mines, navigate rain-slicked forests, and brave the freezing storms of the mountain.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/b97a9e74d12fda63264aaeb75f09397c.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/b97a9e74d12fda63264aaeb75f09397c.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a combination of precise, skill-based gameplay and beautiful, atmospheric environments <strong>Hack And Climb</strong> is a game that anyone can play, but only few can master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/4673127c7a4383823c21154a4155d905.poster.avif?t=1755182060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/4673127c7a4383823c21154a4155d905.webm?t=1755182060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based Platforming</strong>: Master the art of throwing and climbing with your axe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unlockable Weapons</strong>: Discover new ways to conquer &quot;The Climb&quot; as you progress.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but Fair</strong>: Each stage tests your skills while rewarding persistence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Landscapes</strong>: Explore breathtaking, untamed environments each with unique mechanics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Hard&quot; and &quot;Legendary&quot; Difficulties</strong>: Reaching the peak is just the beginning.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Be the weapon! Swing like an axe, thrust like a spear, and soar like an arrow in this physics-based platformer. Flip, throw, and carve your path to the peak! Rage burns, revenge awaits... Are you up to the challenge?",
